@startuml SD-04
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #263E35
skinparam LineColor #263E35
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #F1F4EE
skinparam NoteBorderColor #81947D
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam SequenceGroupBodyBackgroundColor transparent
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title SD-04 / UC-04 - Create a reservation
footer AI-assisted review draft | 2026-11-02
actor Customer as actor
participant "BookBridge" as system
autonumber
actor -> system: Open reservation form for one selected title
system --> actor: Show current price, availability and quantity field
actor -> system: Submit requested quantity in the current customer context
note right of system
Prevent repeat submission while processing.
Recheck current listing, price and stock at
submission.
end note
alt missing customer, invalid quantity or unavailable title
system --> actor: Show reason; keep editable input; no reservation or stock\nchange
else valid customer, listed book and sufficient stock
note right of system
One title; positive integer q. Save unique
reference, owner, q, current price p and
Pending collection. Save stock minus q
together.
end note
alt both changes saved
system --> actor: Show reference, title, q, saved p, amount q x p and\nPending collection
else save fails
system --> actor: Show error; neither reservation nor stock is changed
end
end
note right of system
Refreshing a successful result or repeating
the same submission must not create an
additional reservation.
end note
@enduml
